problem_latex:
Find the eigenvalues of the 5×5 matrix A.

A = \begin{bmatrix} 0 & -3 & -2 & -1 & 5 \\ -3 & 2 & -4 & -2 & -1 \\ -2 & -4 & 6 & 1 & 1 \\ -1 & -2 & 1 & -4 & -4 \\ 5 & -1 & 1 & -4 & 2 \end{bmatrix}

Show all intermediate steps. Put your final numerical answer inside \boxed{}.

